WEBVTT

00:07.625 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:36.745 --> 01:38.905
ADAPTED FROM THE EARLY SPRING ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

01:49.625 --> 01:50.505
Is that him?

01:51.785 --> 01:52.625
That's him.

01:53.585 --> 01:54.745
I've seen his picture.

01:54.825 --> 01:56.985
He sure looks decent. That's him.

01:57.065 --> 01:58.505
Anyone who bullies our daughter
is no better than a dog.

01:58.585 --> 02:00.345
-I'm going to have a word with him.
-No, come back!

02:01.225 --> 02:02.385
-Come back.
-What's wrong?

02:02.465 --> 02:04.105
What are you doing?

02:04.625 --> 02:05.745
Tao isn't back yet.

02:05.825 --> 02:06.945
You're not young anymore.

02:07.025 --> 02:09.584
Trying to pick a fight with him? Honestly.

02:09.665 --> 02:10.945
Doesn't he get under your skin?

02:11.505 --> 02:12.985
Keep it down.

02:13.065 --> 02:14.225
Why should we serve him?

02:14.305 --> 02:16.385
Why feed him? You're treating him
like our son-in-law now.

02:16.465 --> 02:18.505
I didn't serve him.

02:18.585 --> 02:20.545
I didn't even bring out
the dishes he ordered.

02:20.625 --> 02:25.225
He helped himself to the peanuts
and the drinks.

02:25.305 --> 02:26.785
Was I supposed to stop him from drinking?

02:26.865 --> 02:27.945
Jeez.

02:28.025 --> 02:29.185
Boss, bill, please.

02:29.265 --> 02:30.385
Coming.

02:31.545 --> 02:33.545
Here you go. That'll be 150.

02:37.305 --> 02:40.105
Tao, where are you?

02:40.185 --> 02:41.105
Hurry home.

02:41.185 --> 02:42.545
Thank you.

02:42.625 --> 02:43.825
Alright. See you.

02:57.865 --> 02:59.345
We're closed.

03:03.025 --> 03:03.865
Mr. Shang,

03:04.465 --> 03:06.785
it's only eight.
The sign says you close at ten.

03:07.465 --> 03:08.945
Don't call me that.

03:09.025 --> 03:10.825
I own this place.

03:10.905 --> 03:12.825
I'll close whenever I want.

03:13.465 --> 03:15.265
Mr. Shang, I'm waiting for someone.

03:15.945 --> 03:17.425
I told you not to call me that.

03:18.225 --> 03:21.385
Listen. Stop wasting your time.

03:21.465 --> 03:23.425
The person you're waiting for
is not coming today.

03:24.025 --> 03:26.545
How about this?
You and Mrs. Shang go upstairs first.

03:26.625 --> 03:27.585
I'll mind the shop.

03:27.665 --> 03:29.305
I'm not leaving until Tao comes back.

03:29.865 --> 03:31.225
Who says you can call her "Tao"?

03:38.025 --> 03:41.465
LUKE IS MY DOG TOO

03:43.705 --> 03:45.745
Who says you can call her "Tao"?

03:54.865 --> 03:55.705
You're back.

03:57.265 --> 03:58.105
Dad,

03:58.625 --> 04:00.385
I'll close up tonight.
You two go upstairs.

04:01.585 --> 04:02.625
Don't worry.

04:11.225 --> 04:13.865
In that case, take care of yourself.

04:46.745 --> 04:47.665
Mr. Luan,

04:48.265 --> 04:49.705
our tavern is tiny.

04:50.585 --> 04:51.825
Why don't you grab a drink somewhere else?

04:53.185 --> 04:54.345
Let's talk somewhere else.

04:54.425 --> 04:55.625
No need.

04:58.665 --> 05:00.865
If you want to discuss work,
come to the office.

05:00.945 --> 05:04.105
There's nothing to talk about here.

05:08.265 --> 05:09.305
You've always held a grudge against me.

05:14.265 --> 05:18.945
How could I? You're such a big shot.

05:20.025 --> 05:21.465
Why would I hold a grudge?

05:28.145 --> 05:28.985
Tao.

05:30.265 --> 05:31.905
Can you please talk to me nicely?

05:33.025 --> 05:34.865
It's not that I can't.

05:37.345 --> 05:39.545
I just don't have anything to say to you.

06:09.225 --> 06:12.185
You've received 10,000 yuan via Alipay.

06:16.585 --> 06:17.465
Luan Nian.

06:20.305 --> 06:21.705
It's only one plate of peanuts
and one bottle of soda.

06:21.785 --> 06:22.705
Why did you pay 10,000?

06:22.785 --> 06:25.385
If you're that rich,
why don't you just buy this tavern?

06:27.345 --> 06:28.305
Would you sell it?

06:30.385 --> 06:32.305
Everything has a price in your eyes.

06:33.345 --> 06:35.465
Why did you sell
the bags and gifts I gave you?

06:39.585 --> 06:44.465
If it's because I sold your gifts
and left without saying goodbye,

06:44.545 --> 06:45.785
I'll apologize.

06:47.145 --> 06:49.025
I haven't spent a single cent
from selling those bags.

06:49.105 --> 06:50.825
If you want it back,
give me your account number.

06:51.985 --> 06:53.185
I'll transfer the money back.

06:53.265 --> 06:54.305
If you don't,

06:54.385 --> 06:57.305
I'll donate it when I get the chance.
How does that sound?

07:00.985 --> 07:01.825
Keep it.

07:06.745 --> 07:07.585
Alright.

07:09.305 --> 07:10.265
I'll keep it.

07:12.145 --> 07:13.225
Now we're even.

07:16.385 --> 07:17.585
Shang Zhitao.

07:22.105 --> 07:23.065
I'll come back tomorrow.

07:23.865 --> 07:25.505
What exactly do you want?

07:27.545 --> 07:30.145
You want to tell my parents about
what happened between us, don't you?

07:30.745 --> 07:31.905
You don't have to.

07:31.985 --> 07:33.705
I'll tell them right now.

07:33.785 --> 07:36.225
I behaved badly.

07:36.305 --> 07:38.345
I got involved with you
because I wanted to climb the ladder.

07:43.465 --> 07:45.425
I've never thought
of our relationship that way.

07:46.465 --> 07:47.345
Shang Zhitao,

07:48.905 --> 07:50.705
I truly loved you during those six years.

07:55.065 --> 07:55.985
That doesn't matter anymore.

07:59.025 --> 08:00.385
We're over.

08:12.105 --> 08:12.945
Luan Nian,

08:14.985 --> 08:16.265
I'm really tired.

08:20.305 --> 08:22.785
I've barely slept for two days
because of this summit.

08:26.505 --> 08:27.825
Can I drive you home?

08:28.905 --> 08:31.385
When you're exhausted,
driving is dangerous.

08:39.545 --> 08:40.865
OLD COUPLE'S TAVERN

08:55.905 --> 08:57.305
Follow the GPS.

09:13.785 --> 09:15.705
Today's high in Harbin
is minus 13 degrees.

09:15.785 --> 09:18.145
The low is minus 22 degrees.

09:18.225 --> 09:20.025
It's bitterly cold and humid.

09:20.105 --> 09:22.705
Bundle up to keep from getting sick.

11:08.505 --> 11:09.505
Hello?

11:11.145 --> 11:12.105
I'm home.

11:13.145 --> 11:14.625
I'll come get it from you tomorrow.

11:15.665 --> 11:16.785
No need to pick me up.

11:16.865 --> 11:17.705
Okay.

11:18.945 --> 11:19.825
See you tomorrow.

11:45.225 --> 11:46.465
How are you getting back?

11:48.305 --> 11:50.505
It's okay. I can get back by myself.

11:52.665 --> 11:53.505
Thanks.

13:06.745 --> 13:07.665
LUMI

13:07.745 --> 13:10.305
Mr. Luan seems to have taken quite a blow.

13:10.385 --> 13:12.105
He suddenly disappeared.

13:12.825 --> 13:14.505
Are you two together?

14:20.785 --> 14:23.585
Luan Nian, have you lost your mind?
What are you doing out here?

14:26.665 --> 14:27.705
It's freezing.

14:29.225 --> 14:31.745
I thought I'd have a drink to warm up.

14:33.105 --> 14:34.665
Are you trying to freeze to death?

14:34.745 --> 14:36.265
Do you think I'd take responsibility
if something happened to you?

14:38.705 --> 14:40.705
-Would you?
-No.

14:53.305 --> 14:54.785
Do you have a boyfriend now?

14:55.385 --> 14:56.625
What are you talking about?

15:00.745 --> 15:02.945
I heard your assistant
call that guy brother-in-law.

15:05.425 --> 15:06.705
He's not my boyfriend.

15:07.945 --> 15:09.025
He's my fiancé.

15:26.745 --> 15:27.745
Is Luke still alive?

15:28.785 --> 15:30.745
Luke's still young. Why wouldn't he be?

15:30.825 --> 15:31.865
Is he at home?

15:32.705 --> 15:33.545
Yeah.

15:35.145 --> 15:36.305
I want to see him.

15:39.545 --> 15:40.745
I don't want Luke to see you.

15:40.825 --> 15:42.105
He'd be heartbroken.

15:46.105 --> 15:47.305
Even Luke misses me.

15:49.105 --> 15:50.265
You're worse than a dog.

15:53.665 --> 15:54.745
Luan Nian.

15:56.505 --> 15:58.945
We've been tangled up for so many years.

15:59.025 --> 16:00.105
I'm exhausted.

16:02.105 --> 16:03.385
Now,

16:04.065 --> 16:05.945
I just want to live my own life,

16:06.625 --> 16:08.225
take care of my family,

16:08.305 --> 16:10.745
and put my life back in order.

16:12.225 --> 16:13.705
I don't want anything else.

16:15.145 --> 16:18.185
If you have to know
why I left without saying goodbye,

16:19.065 --> 16:23.905
it's because I knew if I'd said goodbye,
you would've said a lot of hurtful things.

16:23.985 --> 16:25.505
I'd had enough of that.

16:35.465 --> 16:36.305
Finished?

16:37.505 --> 16:38.425
Yeah.

16:39.825 --> 16:41.185
Then let me say a few things.

16:43.665 --> 16:44.545
Go ahead.

16:44.625 --> 16:47.225
There's something I think
you deserve to hear from me.

16:49.025 --> 16:50.465
Back when you were up
for the Specialist title,

16:51.305 --> 16:54.345
I gave you a very high score.

16:54.425 --> 16:56.905
I only found out afterward that Song Ying
had been added as your competitor.

16:58.425 --> 16:59.625
You always told me to be fair.

17:00.505 --> 17:01.345
I was.

17:02.505 --> 17:04.424
My score reflected how I saw you.

17:05.265 --> 17:07.785
If you think you weren't good enough

17:07.865 --> 17:09.025
when you first joined Lime,

17:09.905 --> 17:10.865
that you lacked confidence,

17:11.865 --> 17:14.184
or that I looked down
on you even when you left,

17:14.265 --> 17:15.785
then let me make one thing clear.

17:16.305 --> 17:18.464
When you first joined,
you weren't very good.

17:19.745 --> 17:21.145
But by the time you left,

17:22.545 --> 17:23.865
you were the best employee
I'd ever trained.

17:26.865 --> 17:28.224
It was snowing that day too.

17:29.145 --> 17:30.545
You walked out of my place.

17:31.945 --> 17:34.065
You made Luke choose between you and me.

17:37.705 --> 17:39.745
It felt like getting divorced.

17:41.425 --> 17:43.345
At least people
negotiate during a divorce.

17:43.425 --> 17:44.505
But you?

17:44.585 --> 17:46.385
You just walked away.

17:48.985 --> 17:51.425
Did you think you were the only one who
gave your heart over the past six years?

17:52.305 --> 17:53.465
What about mine?

17:55.465 --> 17:56.865
Didn't I try?

18:07.945 --> 18:08.785
Luan Nian.

18:13.025 --> 18:14.505
I'm really grateful

18:14.585 --> 18:16.585
for everything you've done
for me over those years.

18:17.505 --> 18:18.985
I truly appreciate it.

18:20.505 --> 18:24.825
I already wished you well
in the last message I sent you.

18:29.865 --> 18:32.185
I always hope
everything goes well for you.

18:35.305 --> 18:36.585
But…

18:39.545 --> 18:41.985
we still have a long life ahead of us.

18:44.825 --> 18:49.825
There are so many things worth doing
and so many people worth loving.

18:56.985 --> 18:58.625
Go back, Luan Nian.

19:01.425 --> 19:02.425
I'm not leaving.

19:03.945 --> 19:05.425
I want to see Luke right now.

19:07.265 --> 19:09.225
Luke had been with me
since the day we brought him home.

19:09.865 --> 19:11.025
I fed him.

19:11.105 --> 19:13.145
I took him hiking. I walked him.

19:13.225 --> 19:14.945
Why can't I see him?

19:15.025 --> 19:16.745
Because Luke is my dog.

19:16.825 --> 19:18.265
Your dog's name is Luke.

19:19.505 --> 19:21.505
He's named after my English name.

19:27.425 --> 19:29.865
I trained him too. Why can't I see him?

20:17.865 --> 20:18.705
Tao.

20:29.945 --> 20:31.385
You just want to see Luke?

20:34.905 --> 20:35.745
Yes.

20:39.265 --> 20:40.105
Okay.

21:02.345 --> 21:03.345
Luke!

21:04.385 --> 21:05.225
Luke.

21:05.785 --> 21:06.985
Luke.

21:11.185 --> 21:12.425
Let me take a look at you. There, there.

21:14.585 --> 21:15.625
You've gotten thinner.

21:16.385 --> 21:17.585
She doesn't let you eat meat, does she?

21:18.705 --> 21:20.025
His stomach is sensitive.

21:20.105 --> 21:21.625
If he eats too much, he'll throw up.

21:24.425 --> 21:26.025
Looks like Mr. Xing
hasn't been around much.

21:30.985 --> 21:32.465
You had a point.

21:35.665 --> 21:38.745
I shouldn't stop you from seeing Luke.

21:40.105 --> 21:41.505
After all, you raised him.

21:42.105 --> 21:45.265
If you miss him, just let me know.

21:45.945 --> 21:47.545
You can take him out anytime.

21:52.265 --> 21:53.505
I have a few more things to say.

21:56.425 --> 21:57.265
Go ahead.

21:59.905 --> 22:01.025
Don't transfer money to me anymore.

22:03.145 --> 22:05.945
When you do, it reminds me

22:06.905 --> 22:09.625
of how you used to buy me expensive bags.

22:11.025 --> 22:13.345
It makes me very, very uncomfortable.

22:15.705 --> 22:17.745
And don't use any excuses
to see my parents.

22:18.985 --> 22:20.185
I don't like that.

22:22.585 --> 22:25.105
-Alright.
-One more thing.

22:26.385 --> 22:27.745
Things are fine the way they are now.

22:28.545 --> 22:29.585
Let's leave it at that.

22:36.145 --> 22:37.065
Luke.

22:42.305 --> 22:44.345
I'm going now. I'll come see you again.

23:34.625 --> 23:37.025
Mr. Luan, what brings you here?

23:38.505 --> 23:40.545
Well, my boss stepped out.

23:41.785 --> 23:43.625
Please have a seat. I'll give her a call.

23:44.305 --> 23:45.225
No need.

23:45.305 --> 23:47.465
I was just passing by.
I'll leave in a minute.

23:48.785 --> 23:49.825
Have a seat, please.

23:51.865 --> 23:53.505
-Is this her desk?
-Yeah.

24:04.065 --> 24:05.905
SUPPLIER CONTACTS

24:08.345 --> 24:09.185
You like coffee.

24:09.265 --> 24:10.505
Iced Americano.

24:10.585 --> 24:12.105
One moment, please. I'll go buy one now.

24:12.185 --> 24:14.585
Who trained your staff
on client reception?

24:14.665 --> 24:15.625
My boss.

24:15.705 --> 24:17.185
She always says,

24:17.265 --> 24:20.425
"Be tactful when you work,
and never lose your principles."

24:21.025 --> 24:22.305
Anything but sleeping
with clients is fine.

24:25.705 --> 24:27.265
No sleeping with clients?
Did she really say that?

24:29.865 --> 24:30.745
No.

24:31.985 --> 24:33.705
I was trying to be funny.

24:34.785 --> 24:37.745
What she meant was,
be observant and know what people need.

24:42.385 --> 24:43.345
How long have you worked here?

24:44.185 --> 24:45.745
Two years.

24:48.905 --> 24:51.545
Does your boss go on dates often?

24:54.225 --> 24:56.465
Go on dates?

24:57.025 --> 24:58.425
Not at all.

24:59.465 --> 25:01.665
We usually don't get off work until ten.

25:01.745 --> 25:03.265
She stays even later than we do.

25:03.345 --> 25:04.785
So I'd say no.

25:06.745 --> 25:07.785
Are you sure?

25:08.745 --> 25:09.865
I'm sure.

25:12.985 --> 25:14.025
Alright.

25:15.705 --> 25:17.225
The restroom is outside to your right.

25:17.985 --> 25:19.665
I'll get going. I'll visit again sometime.

25:21.945 --> 25:22.825
Take care, Mr. Luan.

25:30.545 --> 25:31.745
Dates?

25:32.425 --> 25:34.265
Why was he asking about that?

25:51.265 --> 25:53.625
-Can I ask you something?
-What is it? You seem anxious.

25:53.705 --> 25:56.345
Are the advertising budgets
for your clients' regional branches

25:56.425 --> 25:57.385
handled separately?

25:59.425 --> 26:01.425
That's usually the case.

26:01.505 --> 26:03.465
The budget is allocated to each
regional office to manage on its own.

26:06.585 --> 26:08.745
A friend of mine
runs an ad agency in Harbin.

26:09.305 --> 26:10.785
Send some budget their way
and let them give it a shot.

26:12.465 --> 26:13.585
Let me put it this way.

26:14.185 --> 26:16.025
Every agency I've introduced to you
does honest work.

26:16.105 --> 26:17.425
They're all solid teams.

26:19.665 --> 26:21.585
Say no more. I know.

26:21.665 --> 26:22.745
It's Shang Zhitao, right?

26:29.865 --> 26:31.945
I'll give you the contact.
Get in touch with them yourself.

26:32.025 --> 26:32.945
The contact person is Fu Dong.

26:37.665 --> 26:40.505
You've been to Harbin so many times

26:41.225 --> 26:42.345
and still got nowhere.

26:51.785 --> 26:52.865
Is Shang Zhitao married?

26:54.945 --> 26:55.945
None of your business.

26:58.625 --> 26:59.825
None of my business.

27:03.545 --> 27:05.225
That's satisfying.
Never thought I'd live to see

27:05.305 --> 27:07.025
someone like you,
who never listens to anyone,

27:07.105 --> 27:08.065
finally brought to heel.

27:08.145 --> 27:09.425
Are you done?

27:10.745 --> 27:13.185
Look, we're all rooting for you
to win her back.

27:14.065 --> 27:16.665
But could you be
a little more straightforward?

27:17.825 --> 27:19.865
If you love someone, just say it.

27:19.945 --> 27:21.505
Be sweet.

27:22.265 --> 27:24.425
Be gentle. See her often.

27:25.225 --> 27:27.785
Take it one step at a time. Don't rush it.

27:44.585 --> 27:47.585
PASTEURIZED EGGS

27:53.905 --> 27:54.745
Who is it?

27:56.865 --> 27:57.905
Why are you here again?

27:58.505 --> 27:59.465
I'm here to see Luke.

28:00.185 --> 28:01.425
Did you tell me in advance?

28:01.505 --> 28:03.705
Luke. Luke.

28:06.305 --> 28:08.345
Look. Look what I brought.

28:08.425 --> 28:11.185
I bought meat.
I'll make you some meatballs later.

28:11.265 --> 28:12.545
You need to fatten up. Good boy.

28:19.425 --> 28:20.305
Let's go, Luke.

28:22.505 --> 28:23.465
Come on.

28:23.545 --> 28:24.865
Luke.

28:31.945 --> 28:32.945
Luke.

28:35.905 --> 28:36.905
Luke.

28:37.545 --> 28:38.945
Look at you drooling.

28:39.545 --> 28:40.585
I'll make them for you later.

28:43.825 --> 28:45.785
I ran into your neighbor
downstairs earlier today.

28:46.305 --> 28:47.905
She asked if I was your boyfriend.

28:51.065 --> 28:51.985
And?

28:53.425 --> 28:54.465
I said yes.

28:57.225 --> 28:59.705
It's fine. My reputation is bad anyway.

29:01.985 --> 29:03.505
That's a relief.

29:03.585 --> 29:05.265
Mine isn't great either.

29:05.345 --> 29:06.905
Two jerks. Perfect match.

29:09.545 --> 29:13.185
Luke, did you hear what he said?

29:13.265 --> 29:15.065
How about we poison him
so he can't talk anymore?

30:48.585 --> 30:49.425
Tao.

30:50.665 --> 30:51.785
Tao.

30:51.865 --> 30:53.105
Oh my.

30:53.185 --> 30:54.745
Mom. Dad.

30:55.345 --> 30:56.745
Why are you here?

30:56.825 --> 30:58.905
There weren't many customers today.

30:58.985 --> 31:01.745
Your dad said we'd bring you some food.

31:04.705 --> 31:06.385
What's wrong?

31:07.105 --> 31:07.945
Can't we come?

31:08.025 --> 31:10.065
Look at this girl. Well, well.

31:10.145 --> 31:11.385
-Honestly.
-Dad, Mom.

31:11.985 --> 31:12.785
Oh my!

31:13.385 --> 31:14.145
Mr. and Mrs. Shang, you are here.

31:16.225 --> 31:17.065
Mr. and Mrs. Shang.

31:18.185 --> 31:19.145
You have a guest?

31:21.785 --> 31:23.065
What is he doing here?

31:24.265 --> 31:25.345
Uh, he…

31:26.705 --> 31:28.025
Well.

31:28.105 --> 31:31.705
Luke has been sick,
so he came to take care of him.

31:32.985 --> 31:34.105
That's right.

31:34.185 --> 31:36.625
Tao is busy,
so I'm helping look after Luke.

31:41.105 --> 31:42.505
Are you cooking?

31:44.625 --> 31:45.745
Perfect timing.

31:45.825 --> 31:47.625
Let's stay and eat together.

31:48.265 --> 31:49.625
We've got guests.

31:49.705 --> 31:50.745
Don't just stand there.

31:50.825 --> 31:52.625
Lend him a hand.

31:52.705 --> 31:53.825
Help with what?

31:53.905 --> 31:55.945
I'm here to eat, not to work.

32:04.425 --> 32:05.905
Well. Luan…

32:06.425 --> 32:07.785
Luan Nian.

32:08.545 --> 32:09.425
Want a drink?

32:10.385 --> 32:11.545
Sure. I'll have a drink with you.

32:11.625 --> 32:12.625
Come.

32:15.265 --> 32:18.425
The first toast is for you.

32:18.505 --> 32:20.345
Welcome to Harbin.

32:20.945 --> 32:22.065
Thank you, Mr. Shang.

32:28.265 --> 32:29.105
The second toast.

32:30.305 --> 32:31.665
Thank you

32:31.745 --> 32:33.545
for supporting our tavern last time.

32:34.225 --> 32:35.225
My pleasure.

32:39.945 --> 32:41.545
Not eating the dishes?

32:41.625 --> 32:43.025
The third toast.

32:43.105 --> 32:44.145
Thank you

32:45.185 --> 32:47.185
and your friends for looking after her

32:47.265 --> 32:50.265
when Tao was all alone in Beijing.

32:51.065 --> 32:52.145
Come on.

32:54.585 --> 32:55.545
Have a bite.

32:55.625 --> 32:57.305
-Soak up the alcohol. Eat the dishes.
-Here.

32:57.385 --> 33:00.665
Also, thank you for taking care of Luke.

33:01.265 --> 33:03.105
Are you sure you want to continue?

33:03.865 --> 33:05.905
Don't worry. He's a young man.

33:05.985 --> 33:06.905
Well.

33:09.185 --> 33:10.545
That's enough.

33:10.625 --> 33:11.625
At least eat something.

33:20.185 --> 33:21.545
Here. Drink it.

33:21.625 --> 33:22.705
Sure.

33:24.265 --> 33:25.145
Thank you.

33:25.225 --> 33:26.505
Are you hiding something from me?

33:26.585 --> 33:27.465
You looked after Luke well.

33:28.345 --> 33:30.665
-I'm not.
-Wishing Luke good health as he grows up.

33:30.745 --> 33:31.905
You're hiding something from your mom.

33:31.985 --> 33:33.785
Don't interrupt.

33:34.785 --> 33:36.145
Listen to me.

33:36.825 --> 33:38.345
You… You…

33:39.145 --> 33:40.585
Have you thought this through?

33:40.665 --> 33:42.305
I'm always on your side.

33:43.185 --> 33:45.225
-I'm really not hiding anything.
-Tell me.

33:46.265 --> 33:48.385
-A spoiled child never turns out well.
-Come on.

33:48.465 --> 33:49.385
One more…

33:49.465 --> 33:51.265
-You're hiding something from me.
-Here you go.

33:51.345 --> 33:52.225
That's the last.

33:52.865 --> 33:54.465
-Come on.
-Don't let him drink anymore.

33:54.545 --> 33:55.385
-Here you go.
-Oh my.

33:55.465 --> 33:57.505
Luke is closer to you

33:58.265 --> 34:00.505
than he is to Tao. Drink up.

34:00.585 --> 34:01.945
Stop drinking, Dad.

34:02.025 --> 34:02.945
-He can drink himself.
-Shang.

34:03.025 --> 34:04.545
-Shang, stop it. No.
-Luan, cheers.

34:04.625 --> 34:05.545
-He's drunk enough.
-What now?

34:05.625 --> 34:07.425
-I'll finish it.
-Don't drink anymore.

34:11.225 --> 34:13.264
-Lan.
-Lan is not his name.

34:13.344 --> 34:14.264
It's Luan.

34:14.344 --> 34:15.585
Not Lan.

34:15.665 --> 34:17.105
-Luan.
-Yes, I'm Luan.

34:17.185 --> 34:18.665
Mr. Shang, let's keep drinking.

34:18.744 --> 34:20.665
-No.
-Let's drink some more.

34:20.744 --> 34:21.905
-Stop it. Don't.
-That's enough.

34:21.985 --> 34:23.545
My daughter needs to rest.

34:23.625 --> 34:24.705
Which hotel are you staying at?

34:24.784 --> 34:25.865
Not drinking anymore?

34:29.625 --> 34:30.505
Where's he staying?

34:30.585 --> 34:32.425
-How would I know?
-The room next door?

34:32.505 --> 34:34.185
I asked which hotel.

34:34.264 --> 34:36.344
I'm staying at the hotel
next door, Mrs. Shang.

34:36.425 --> 34:37.824
Alright. Let's go.

34:37.905 --> 34:38.744
We'll leave together.

34:38.824 --> 34:39.665
Oh my…

34:39.744 --> 34:41.545
-Not drinking anymore?
-Are you leaving already?

34:41.625 --> 34:42.705
Easy there.

34:44.545 --> 34:46.425
-Young man. Young man, wait.
-That's not the door.

34:46.505 --> 34:47.545
That's not the door.

34:47.625 --> 34:49.865
He's a lightweight.

34:49.945 --> 34:50.865
-Easy.
-I'm fine.

34:50.945 --> 34:51.824
I can walk by myself.

34:51.905 --> 34:53.264
Don't throw my dad's back out.

34:53.344 --> 34:55.744
-Walk by yourself. Let him walk.
-Go on.

34:55.824 --> 34:57.025
-Slow down.
-I'm fine.

34:57.105 --> 34:58.505
Easy.

34:59.305 --> 35:00.425
Can he make it?

35:00.505 --> 35:02.505
-Can he make it?
-He's a young man.

35:02.585 --> 35:03.545
He holds his liquor well.

35:04.065 --> 35:05.825
He's well-mannered when he's drunk.

35:05.905 --> 35:07.425
You got him completely wasted.

35:07.505 --> 35:08.425
You poured him drink after drink.

35:08.505 --> 35:09.625
He didn't even have a bite to eat.

35:09.705 --> 35:11.305
The way someone acts
when they're drunk says a lot about them.

35:11.385 --> 35:13.145
At least this trip wasn't for nothing.

35:14.305 --> 35:16.265
Alright. Go get some rest.

35:16.345 --> 35:17.185
Go to bed early.

35:18.945 --> 35:19.905
-Luan.
-Bye.

35:19.985 --> 35:20.825
Wait.

35:20.905 --> 35:22.625
-Let's go together.
-Easy now.

35:22.705 --> 35:25.305
-Come.
-What's the rush?

35:52.425 --> 35:54.185
Why are you back?

35:55.705 --> 35:57.785
The hotel's fully booked. Excuse me.

36:01.585 --> 36:02.425
I have nowhere else to stay.

36:11.905 --> 36:13.305
Weren't you drunk?

36:14.865 --> 36:16.345
That wasn't enough to do it.

36:16.425 --> 36:17.385
You were faking.

36:19.465 --> 36:20.545
I'll take the guest room.

36:21.065 --> 36:22.505
Did I tell you to undress?

36:22.585 --> 36:24.225
Did I say yes?

36:26.945 --> 36:28.945
Knowing how hospitable
people in Harbin are,

36:29.025 --> 36:30.585
you wouldn't leave me out
on the street, would you?

36:31.425 --> 36:32.865
What exactly… Luan Nian.

36:35.825 --> 36:36.865
What do you want?

36:39.905 --> 36:41.105
I'll sleep on the couch if I have to.

36:49.825 --> 36:50.945
Suit yourself.

38:24.825 --> 38:25.665
Shang Zhitao,

38:27.585 --> 38:28.865
I know you're still awake.

38:30.025 --> 38:31.265
Just let me say a few things.

38:32.825 --> 38:33.745
You don't have to answer.

38:38.905 --> 38:41.345
After you left, I thought about us a lot.

38:44.025 --> 38:45.905
I know you put up with a lot

38:47.465 --> 38:49.025
in our relationship.

38:51.025 --> 38:54.385
You endured so much just to be with me
because you loved me.

38:58.745 --> 39:00.105
But back then,

39:01.145 --> 39:02.225
I was too arrogant.

39:03.905 --> 39:05.105
I realized everything too late.

39:07.145 --> 39:08.305
I didn't treat you well enough.

39:11.185 --> 39:12.785
But my feelings were real.

39:14.665 --> 39:15.905
I'm sure you could tell.

39:30.145 --> 39:32.265
When I said I wanted to take care
of Luke with you, I meant it.

39:34.105 --> 39:35.265
We've still got a long road ahead.

39:36.745 --> 39:37.785
I'll take it one step at a time.

39:44.345 --> 39:45.185
Shang Zhitao,

39:48.065 --> 39:48.905
I'm sorry.

39:51.505 --> 39:52.785
For everything that happened.

40:18.985 --> 40:20.465
The old me always thought

40:21.865 --> 40:23.625
I wasn't good enough.

40:24.825 --> 40:26.345
Even so, I knew I was loved.

40:29.545 --> 40:30.905
We really did love each other.

40:32.225 --> 40:34.145
But he was too proud,

40:34.745 --> 40:36.065
and I was too insecure.

40:36.705 --> 40:39.545
Neither of us would back down.

40:41.305 --> 40:42.145
Why?

40:42.945 --> 40:44.625
Why is he always like this?

40:45.265 --> 40:47.265
Every time I make up my mind,

40:49.785 --> 40:53.145
he shows up and undoes
everything I've worked so hard for.

41:21.185 --> 41:22.185
Why are you here?

41:22.265 --> 41:23.865
I brought Luke breakfast.

41:23.945 --> 41:25.985
I'll check on him
before heading to the airport.

41:30.585 --> 41:31.745
Luke.

41:35.585 --> 41:36.785
Luke.

41:36.865 --> 41:38.145
Come here, Luke.

41:41.345 --> 41:42.785
Come, let's not eat bread.

41:43.585 --> 41:45.305
It's not good. It has no nutrition.

42:08.705 --> 42:10.465
Shang Zhitao, is this how you live?

42:11.345 --> 42:12.745
You don't even have an egg in the fridge.

42:12.825 --> 42:15.585
Mr. Luan, I don't know how to cook.

42:16.545 --> 42:19.465
Ms. Shang, you can always
learn to cook for yourself.

42:19.545 --> 42:21.745
Why would I learn?

42:21.825 --> 42:24.785
I can order takeout or eat at my mom's.

42:24.865 --> 42:26.265
Worst case,

42:26.825 --> 42:28.545
I'll find a boyfriend who can cook.

42:31.185 --> 42:33.865
Don't you already have one?
Isn't he your fiancé?

42:34.745 --> 42:36.585
Want me to remind him
to come cook for you?

42:36.665 --> 42:39.545
Tell him to step up his game.

42:44.185 --> 42:45.025
I'll cook for you.

42:46.665 --> 42:47.825
And for Luke.

42:50.865 --> 42:51.985
I've got to get to work.
